{"suttaId":"sn35.136","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[880,896],"vripara":"136"},"segments":{"sn35.136:0.3":"Paṭhamarūpārāmasuttaṃ","sn35.136:1.1":"“Rūpārāmā, bhikkhave, devamanussā rūparatā rūpasammuditā.","sn35.136:1.2":"Rūpavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā dukkhā, bhikkhave, devamanussā viharanti.","sn35.136:1.3":"Saddārāmā, bhikkhave, devamanussā saddaratā saddasammuditā.","sn35.136:1.4":"Saddavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā dukkhā, bhikkhave, devamanussā viharanti.","sn35.136:1.5":"Gandhārāmā …","sn35.136:1.6":"rasārāmā …","sn35.136:1.7":"phoṭṭhabbārāmā …","sn35.136:1.8":"dhammārāmā, bhikkhave, devamanussā dhammaratā dhammasammuditā.","sn35.136:1.9":"Dhammavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā dukkhā, bhikkhave, devamanussā viharanti.","sn35.136:1.10":"Tathāgato ca kho, bhikkhave, arahaṃ sammāsambuddho rūpānaṃ samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavaṃ ca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṃ viditvā na rūpārāmo na rūparato na rūpasammudito. Saddānaṃ … gandhānaṃ … rasānaṃ … phoṭṭhabbānaṃ … dhammānaṃ samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavañca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṃ viditvā na dhammārāmo, na dhammarato, na dhammasammudito.","sn35.136:1.17":"Dhammavipariṇāmavirāganirodhā sukho, bhikkhave, tathāgato viharati”.","sn35.136:1.18":"Idamavoca bhagavā.","sn35.136:1.19":"Idaṃ vatvāna sugato athāparaṃ etadavoca satthā –","sn35.136:2.1":"“Rūpā saddā rasā gandhā,","sn35.136:2.2":"phassā dhammā ca kevalā;","sn35.136:2.3":"Iṭṭhā kantā manāpā ca,","sn35.136:2.4":"yāvatatthīti vuccati.","sn35.136:3.1":"“Sadevakassa lokassa,","sn35.136:3.2":"ete vo sukhasammatā;","sn35.136:3.3":"Yattha cete nirujjhanti,","sn35.136:3.4":"taṃ tesaṃ dukkhasammataṃ.","sn35.136:4.1":"“Sukhaṃ [sukhanti (sī.)] diṭṭhamariyebhi,","sn35.136:4.2":"sakkāyassa nirodhanaṃ;","sn35.136:4.3":"Paccanīkamidaṃ hoti,","sn35.136:4.4":"sabbalokena passataṃ.","sn35.136:5.1":"“Yaṃ pare sukhato āhu,","sn35.136:5.2":"tadariyā āhu dukkhato;","sn35.136:5.3":"Yaṃ pare dukkhato āhu,","sn35.136:5.4":"tadariyā sukhato vidū.","sn35.136:6.1":"“Passa dhammaṃ durājānaṃ,","sn35.136:6.2":"sammūḷhettha aviddasu;","sn35.136:6.3":"Nivutānaṃ tamo hoti,","sn35.136:6.4":"andhakāro apassataṃ.","sn35.136:7.1":"“Satañca vivaṭaṃ hoti,","sn35.136:7.2":"āloko passatāmi;","sn35.136:7.3":"Santike na vijānanti,","sn35.136:7.4":"maggā [magā (sī.)] dhammassa akovidā.","sn35.136:8.1":"“Bhavarāgaparetebhi,","sn35.136:8.2":"bhavarāgānusārībhi [bhavasotānusāribhi (syā. kaṃ. pī.), bhavasotānusārihi (sī.)];","sn35.136:8.3":"Māradheyyānupannehi,","sn35.136:8.4":"nāyaṃ dhammo susambudho.","sn35.136:9.1":"“Ko nu aññatra mariyebhi,","sn35.136:9.2":"padaṃ sambuddhumarahati;","sn35.136:9.3":"Yaṃ padaṃ sammadaññāya,","sn35.136:9.4":"parinibbanti anāsavā”ti.","sn35.136:9.5":"tatiyaṃ;"},"unsure":["sn35.136:1.10"],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":258,"to":261,"paras":[{"para":258,"vripara":"136","refs":["sn35.136:1","sn35.136:2","sn35.136:3","sn35.136:4","sn35.136:5"],"lines":["Tatiye <b>rūpasammuditā</b>ti rūpe sammuditā pamoditā.","<b>Dukkhā</b>ti dukkhitā.","<b>Sukho</b>ti nibbānasukhena sukhito.","<b>Kevalā</b>ti sakalā.","<b>Yāvatatthīti vuccatī</b>ti yattakā atthīti vuccati.","<b>Ete vo</b>ti ettha vo-kāro nipātamattaṃ.","<b>Paccanīkamidaṃ hoti, sabbalokena passatan</b>ti yaṃ idaṃ passantānaṃ paṇḍitānaṃ dassanaṃ, taṃ sabbalokena paccanīkaṃ hoti viruddhaṃ.","Loko hi pañcakkhandhe niccā sukhā attā subhāti maññati, paṇḍitā aniccā dukkhā anattā asubhāti.","<b>Sukhato āhū</b>ti sukhanti kathenti.","<b>Sukhato vidū</b>ti sukhanti jānanti.","Sabbametaṃ nibbānameva sandhāya vuttaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:3"],["sn35.136:4"],["sn35.136:4"],["sn35.136:5"],["sn35.136:5"],["sn35.136:5"]]},{"para":259,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.136:6"],"lines":["<b>Sammūḷhetthā</b>ti ettha nibbāne sammūḷhā.","<b>Aviddasū</b>ti bālā.","Sabbepi hi channavutipāsaṇḍino “nibbānaṃ pāpuṇissāmā”ti saññino honti, te pana “nibbānaṃ nāma idan” tipi na jānanti.","<b>Nivutānan</b>ti kilesanīvaraṇena nivutānaṃ pariyonaddhānaṃ.","<b>Andhakāro apassatan</b>ti apassantānaṃ andhakāro hoti.","Kiṃ taṃ evaṃ hoti?","Nibbānaṃ vā nibbānadassanaṃ vā apassantānañhi bālānaṃ nibbānampi nibbānadassanampi kāḷameghaavacchāditaṃ viya candamaṇḍalaṃ kaṭāhena paṭikujjitapatto viya ca niccakālaṃ tamo ceva andhakāro ca sampajjati."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"]]},{"para":260,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.136:6"],"lines":["<b>Satañca vivaṭaṃ hoti, āloko passatāmivā</b>ti satañca sappurisānaṃ paññādassanena passantānaṃ nibbānaṃ āloko viya vivaṭaṃ hoti.","<b>Santike na vijānanti, magā dhammassa akovidā</b>ti yaṃ attano sarīre kese vā lomādīsu vā aññatarakoṭṭhāsaṃ paricchinditvā anantarameva adhigantabbato attano vā khandhānaṃ nirodhamaggato santike nibbānaṃ.","Taṃ evaṃ santike samānampi maggabhūtā janā maggāmaggadhammassa catusaccadhammassa vā akovidā na jānanti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"],["sn35.136:6"]]},{"para":261,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.136:8","sn35.136:9"],"lines":["<b>Māradheyyānupannehī</b>ti tebhūmakavaṭṭaṃ mārassa nivāsaṭṭhānaṃ anupannehi.","<b>Ko nu aññatra ariyebhī</b>ti ṭhapetvā ariye ko nu añño nibbānapadaṃ jānituṃ arahati.","<b>Sammadaññāya parinibbantī</b>ti arahattapaññāya sammā jānitvā anantarameva anāsavā hutvā kilesaparinibbānena parinibbanti.","Atha vā sammadaññāya anāsavā hutvā ante khandhaparinibbānena parinibbāyanti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.136:8"],["sn35.136:8"],["sn35.136:9"],["sn35.136:9"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.136:1.1","rūpasammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.10","rūpasammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.2","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.4","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.9","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.17","sukho",0,2],["sn35.136:2.1","kevalā",0,3],["sn35.136:2.3","yāvatatthīti vuccatī",0,4],["sn35.136:3.1","ete vo",0,5],["sn35.136:4.3","paccanīkamidaṃ hoti sabbalokena passataṃ",0,6],["sn35.136:5.1","sukhato āhū",0,8],["sn35.136:5.3","sukhato vidū",0,9],["sn35.136:6.1","sammūḷhetthā",1,0],["sn35.136:6.1","aviddasū",1,1],["sn35.136:6.3","nivutānaṃ",1,3],["sn35.136:6.3","andhakāro apassataṃ",1,4],["sn35.136:8.3","māradheyyānupannehī",3,0],["sn35.136:9.3","sammadaññāya parinibbantī",3,2]],"before":[{"para":253,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ayaṃ kammabhūmi idha maggabhāvanā,"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":254,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ṭhānāni saṃvejaniyā bahū idha;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":255,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Saṃvegasaṃvejaniyesu vatthusu,"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":256,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Saṃvegajātova payuñca yoniso”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":257,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭhamarūpārāmasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":267,"to":267,"paras":[{"para":267,"vripara":"136","refs":["sn35.136:1","sn35.136:2"],"lines":["<b>Sammuditā</b> sammodappattā, <b>pamoditā</b> sañjātapamodā.","<b>Dukkhā</b>ti dukkhavanto sañjātadukkhā.","Tenāha <b>“dukkhitā”</b>ti.","Sukhaṃ etassa atthīti <b>sukho,</b> sukhī.","Tenāha <b>“sukhito”</b>ti.","<b>Yattakā</b> rūpādayo dhammā loke <b>atthīti vuccati.</b>","<b>Passantānan</b>ti saccapaṭivedhena sammadeva passantānaṃ.","<b>“Paccanīkaṃ hotī”</b>ti vatvā taṃ paccanīkabhāvaṃ dassetuṃ <b>“loko hī”</b>tiādi vuttaṃ.","<b>Asubhā</b>ti “āhū” tipadaṃ ānetvā sambandho.","<b>Sabbametan</b>ti “sukhaṃ diṭṭhamariyebhi … pe … tadariyā sukhato vidū”ti ca vuttaṃ.","Sabbametaṃ nibbānameva sandhāya vuttaṃ.","Nibbānameva hi ekantato sukhaṃ nāma."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:1"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"],["sn35.136:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.136:1.1","sammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.3","sammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.5","sammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.10","sammuditā",0,0],["sn35.136:1.2","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.4","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.9","dukkhā",0,1],["sn35.136:1.17","sukho",0,3],["sn35.136:2.3","atthīti vuccati",0,5]],"before":[{"para":264,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Ayaṃ kammabhūmī</b>ti ayaṃ manussaloko purisathāmakaraṇāya kammabhūmi nāma tāsaṃ yogyaṭṭhānabhāvato.","Tattha padhānakammaṃ dassento <b>“idha maggabhāvanā”</b>ti āha.","<b>Ṭhānānī</b>ti kāraṇāni.","<b>Saṃvejaniyānī</b>ti saṃvegajananāni bahūni jātiādīni.","Tathā hi jāti, jarā, byādhi, maraṇaṃ, apāyabhavaṃ, tatthapi nirayūpapattihetukaṃ, tiracchānupapattihetukaṃ, asūrakāyūpapattihetukaṃ, atīte vaṭṭamūlakaṃ, anāgate vaṭṭamūlakaṃ, paccuppanne āhārapariyeṭṭhimūlakanti bahūni saṃvegavatthūni paccavekkhitvā <b>saṃvegajāto</b> sañjātasaṃvego yoniso padhānamanuyuñjassu.","<b>Saṃvegā</b>ti saṃvegamāpajjassu."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":265,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Khaṇasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":266,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭhamarūpārāmasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
